invariant: INV-33
file: webpki.c
catches: webpki_chain_test
reason: the walk frames an entry up to CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX, the
  cap pins alone take, in place of its own CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, so an
  entry past the certificate the walk stops at passes unread at any size
  a message carries, and CH_TRUST_MIN_RXBUF, which counts four entries at
  CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, no longer holds the largest message the walk
  accepts. test/webpki_chain_test.c's entry size rows, which want a
  trailing entry of 3073 bytes and the corpus leaf over the cap refused,
  object.

--- old
        int rc = webpki_read_entry(&r, CH_WEBPKI_CERT_MAX, &out->cert[out->count],
--- new
        int rc = webpki_read_entry(&r, CH_WEBPKI_LEAF_PIN_CERT_MAX, &out->cert[out->count],
